3. **Execution Latency & Cold-Start Dynamics:** Introduction of cross-region network hops during Cloud Run container instantiation, increasing MCP cold-start latency by $1.8\times \text{--} 3.4\times$.
4. **Lifecycle Obsolescence Cliff:** Exposure to Google Container Registry deprecation milestones and breaking changes when GCR traffic is force-redirected or terminated.

This RFC delivers the biomorphic dialectical deliberation, formal invariant analysis, concrete data structures, resilient client-side connection recovery algorithms, and an architectural remediation blueprint.

