- **Post-change:** Requires broad Cloud Storage write permissions (`roles/storage.admin` or `roles/storage.objectAdmin`) over the deployment bucket `gs://artifacts.<project-id>.appspot.com`. This exposes all other GCS assets to the Cloud Build service account if not strictly partitioned.

