The JavaScript migration is retained for deployment agility and dynamic introspection, but **Strict Boundary Guards** must be established at every I/O junction, inter-agent queue, and state transition.

---

## 3. Impact Analysis on Downstream Architecture & System Invariants

| System Subsystem | TypeScript Invariant | JavaScript Risk | Architectural Mitigation Required |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Event Bus (`event-bus.js`)** | Compile-time event name & payload payload typing | Unchecked event emissions; silent field drops | Enforce runtime Zod schema registry on `emit()` |
