## Pre-Caching Semantic Schema Lineage via Background Idle Cycles

* **Status:** Proposed / Deliberated
* **Target Project:** `metabase-ai-assistant` (`/workspace/metabase-ai-assistant`)
* **Author:** Quanta SDK Biomorphic Cognitive Engine (Deliberation Engine)
* **Date:** 2026-10-07
