  │ in background worker threads."│                                                           │                               │
  ├───────────────────────────────┤                                                           ├───────────────────────────────┤
  │ "Continuously poll Metabase   │ ───► [Contention: Rate-limits & CPU starvation in MCP]──► │ "Cooperative 12ms time-slice  │
