## 7. AI-Ready Agent Primitives (Google cognitive_agent SDK Alignment)

As onmartech transitions toward **Agent as a Service (AaaS)**, packages must expose structured interfaces and deterministic Zod schemas so that AGY agents can programmatically manipulate UI states, trigger WhatsApp workflows, and publish content without parsing raw React components.

```typescript
// packages/types/src/agent-schemas.ts
import { z } from 'zod';

export const WhatsAppMessageActionSchema = z.object({
  recipientPhone: z.string().regex(/^\+?[1-9]\d{1,14}$/, 'Invalid E.164 phone format'),
  templateId: z.string().min(1),
  templateParams: z.record(z.string()),
  fallbackWaMeUrl: z.string().url(),
});

export const SocialPublishActionSchema = z.object({
  targetPlatforms: z.array(z.enum(['telegram', 'instagram', 'sanity'])),
  title: z.string().min(1).max(255),
  contentMarkdown: z.string(),
  mediaUrls: z.array(z.string().url()).max(10),
  scheduleTime: z.string().datetime().optional(),
});

export type WhatsAppMessageAction = z.infer<typeof WhatsAppMessageActionSchema>;
export type SocialPublishAction = z.infer<typeof SocialPublishActionSchema>;
```

