## 8. Edge Cases, Safety Bounds, & Failure Recovery

| Scenario / Edge Case | Failure Mode | Architectural Defense & Safety Bound |
|---|---|---|
| **Storage Quota Exceeded** | `localStorage.setItem` throws `QuotaExceededError` on large images. | IndexedDB primary store + automatic LRU pruning of payloads older than 7 days. |
| **Telegram Rate Limit (HTTP 429)** | Subsequent site visitors get blank social widgets. | SWR engine serves stale cached entries indefinitely with `isStale: true` until the API resets. |
| **RSC Component Import** | Importing `@onmartech/ui` components into server-only files. | `tsup` inserts `'use client'` directive to root bundles; `tokens` are exported as pure pure JSON/objects via `@onmartech/ui/tokens`. |
| **Canvas Tree-Shaking Failure** | Client sites importing simple buttons receive 200KB `@xyflow` bundle. | Subpath separation (`@onmartech/ui/canvas`), isolating React Flow into a dedicated entrypoint. |
| **Firebase Auth Token Expiry** | SSR page render fails during token refresh. | Graceful fallback to unauthenticated state with edge redirect to `/login` via HTTP-only cookie. |

